    "a non-empty caller_name -> `Captured Caller` (it was empty)",
    "kept verbatim: statuses, times, durations, prices, the TwiML and request defaults",
    "the build refuses to write on any provider_capture.find_leaks rule, env secret (value, phone variants, sha256 prefix) or raw value in the output bytes"
